				Time="2011-10-13T14:01:46" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>攻撃が　連続で
だせない。</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="ichiraku_katsuhiko:W00271"
				Time="2011-10-13T14:01:46" />
			<Status>Editing</Status>
			<StatusModifiedBy
